# Copy to .env (gitignored) only on the machine that provisions publishers
# with toolctl, the maintainer's internal provisioning tool (a separate
# private repository; see docs/remote.md#provisioning for doing it by hand).
# A Synadia Cloud API token with access to the account that holds the
# cc-sessions bucket, read by tools\make-publisher-bundle.ps1 and passed to
# toolctl's process only. Prefer `toolctl auth login` (OS credential store)
# over this file, and keep the repository outside a synced folder if you use
# it.
SYNADIA_CLOUD_ACCESS_TOKEN=
